{
 "name": "wall_x_night",
 "saveFile": "minimal_colony.rws",
 "hideUi": true,
 "description": "Night-time repro for the per-wall-tile 'black square with an X fading inside it' report. Sealed 15x15 wood-walled RoofConstructed room, two torches, hour 0, camera on the west and north wall runs at closest zoom. Each arm turns one subsystem that writes lighting-overlay or desaturation vertices off, shoots the same two frames, and turns it back on; a same-arm repeat gives the noise floor. Runs against whatever preset is persisted (the report came from Realistic with both brightness floors at 0).",
